  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I never want to be in a public world -- I only ever want to play with friends.  However, so much of the UI is geared around the assumption of public worlds (especially portals placed by world authors!) that it's easy to accidentally wind up in a public world without meaning to.  It would be nice if there could be a setting that would prevent accidentally joining public worlds -- either completely, or at least with an extra \"are you sure?\" prompt.  This would also make VRChat safer to use for younger users, or people who aren't experienced with computers like the elderly.",
